{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Major Axel Vex, a veteran of Extraterrestrial Incident Response, dispatched to investigate a distress signal from Cengona Base - an  underground research facility on a distant exoplanet. What begins as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a desperate battle for survival against an entity that turns both mind and matter against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Navigate through 26 unique sectors of a massive underground base, each with its own dangers and secrets<br>\u2022 Manage your resources and choose your battles wisely against sinister entities <br>\u2022 Uncover the truth through recovered logs, security footage, and the haunting remains of the base's personnel</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FACE THE INFECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Confront hostile entities that are controlled by a mysterious biological force<br>\u2022 Experience dynamic horror that adapts to your actions and decisions<br>\u2022 Solve environmental puzzles while avoiding detection by creatures that hunt through light and movement</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Unique blend of psychological and biological horror<br>\u2022 Atmospheric survival horror set in a claustrophobic underground facility<br>\u2022 Strategic resource management<br>\u2022 Immersive sound design that heightens tension and aids survival<br>\u2022 Rich narrative told through environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Can you resist the breach?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HELL OF FEAR: Mind Breach is a game designed by Tayfun Tuna and developed by Cenk Bilgin. It represents our vision of a new era in psychological survival horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> This game contains scenes of intense horror, violence, and psychological distress. Player discretion is advised.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3372090?t=1742479656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742479656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/d340fa0ca5b9ff367eaf8120e042df748a9aae6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742479656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/d340fa0ca5b9ff367eaf8120e042df748a9aae6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742479656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Battle against alien monsters, much like \"Dead Space\" series."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Major Axel Vex, a veteran of Extraterrestrial Incident Response, dispatched to investigate a distress signal from Cengona Base - an  underground research facility on a distant exoplanet. What begins as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a desperate battle for survival against an entity that turns both mind and matter against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Navigate through 26 unique sectors of a massive underground base, each with its own dangers and secrets<br>\u2022 Manage your resources and choose your battles wisely against sinister entities <br>\u2022 Uncover the truth through recovered logs, security footage, and the haunting remains of the base's personnel</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FACE THE INFECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Confront hostile entities that are controlled by a mysterious biological force<br>\u2022 Experience dynamic horror that adapts to your actions and decisions<br>\u2022 Solve environmental puzzles while avoiding detection by creatures that hunt through light and movement</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Unique blend of psychological and biological horror<br>\u2022 Atmospheric survival horror set in a claustrophobic underground facility<br>\u2022 Strategic resource management<br>\u2022 Immersive sound design that heightens tension and aids survival<br>\u2022 Rich narrative told through environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Can you resist the breach?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HELL OF FEAR: Mind Breach is a game designed by Tayfun Tuna and developed by Cenk Bilgin. It represents our vision of a new era in psychological survival horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> This game contains scenes of intense horror, violence, and psychological distress. Player discretion is advised.</p>","developers":["Tayfun Tuna","Cenk Bilgin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/header.jpg?t=1742479656","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113005,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113005/movie480.mp4?t=1741709407","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113005/movie_max.mp4?t=1741709407"},"name":"Official Action Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113005/3a21d6b010140c003ff28fc1046af621df42f1a3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741709407","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113005/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741709407","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113005/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741709407"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257076728,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257076728/movie480.mp4?t=1732827720","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com